  SOPHIE GERMAIN PRIMES AND RAPIDITY:
  A Sophie Germain prime p has 2p+1 also prime.
  In rapidity: if c is such that 2c+1=p (Sophie Germain), then 2(2c+1)+1=2p+1
  is also prime, meaning node 2c+1 (= (p-1)/2 doubled +1) is also a 'prime node'.

  Sophie Germain primes < 200: [2, 3, 5, 11, 23, 29, 41, 53, 83, 89, 113, 131, 173, 179, 191]

